<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 17.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIXTURES -</p>
<p>TBN 80,000 long tons grain River Plate/Cont. end Oct $14.00 two to one 16 days Cargill.</p>
<p>TBN 52,500/5 long tons heavy grain USG/S.Korea 25-30/10 $17.90 fio 10,000/7,500 Halla.</p>
<p>Amy Thompson 15,600 minmax long tons wheat USG//Pto Cortes 10-20/12 $41.24 mtrctn fio 4,000/1,000 Agency for International Development.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
